# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DollarAndGold environment
#
# EVERY variable here is optional. With none of them set, the app still runs:
# crypto and major FX use live keyless sources, everything else falls back to
# the simulation, and each figure is labelled with where it came from.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in what you have.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Market data -----------------------------------------------------------
# Sources are tried in priority order, per symbol, and the app falls back to
# the simulation only when none of them can answer.
#
#   1. Twelve Data   — key required. The only source covering the WHOLE catalog
#                      (spot metals, FX, crypto, indices, equities). Free tier:
#                      800 requests/day, 8/minute. Set this to make gold, oil,
#                      NASDAQ, S&P 500 and the equities live.
#                      https://twelvedata.com/pricing
#   2. CoinGecko     — keyless. Crypto. Works out of the box.
#   3. Frankfurter   — keyless. ECB reference rates for major FX pairs.
#                      Daily granularity only, so it does not serve 1D/1W charts.
#   4. Yahoo Finance — keyless, best effort, ranked last. Broad coverage but an
#                      undocumented endpoint with no SLA that throttles hard.
#
# The single highest-value variable in this file:
TWELVE_DATA_API_KEY=

# Optional. A free CoinGecko demo key only raises the rate limit.
COINGECKO_API_KEY=

# Set to "true" to stop using Yahoo entirely.
DISABLE_YAHOO_FALLBACK=

# Set to "simulated" to pin every market to the deterministic simulation.
# Useful for reproducible screenshots, demos and tests.
MARKET_DATA_MODE=

# --- AI narration and chat (optional) --------------------------------------
# Without this, analyses are written by the deterministic rules engine and the
# chat assistant answers from its glossary and the analysis engine.
# With it, Claude writes the prose and powers the assistant.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Accounts and sync (optional) ------------------------------------------
# Without these, the app runs in demo mode: the watchlist, notes and trading
# journal are stored in localStorage and the sign-in page says so.
# With them, users get real accounts and their workspace syncs across devices.
# Create a project at https://supabase.com, then run supabase/schema.sql.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- DollarAndGold AI / /ai-trader (optional, private admin tool) ----------
# Encrypts Bybit API credentials before they're stored (AES-256-GCM,
# lib/ai-trader/credentials.ts). Without it, /ai-trader's "Connect Bybit"
# form will fail to save — everything else on the page still works.
# Generate one with: openssl rand -hex 32
AI_TRADER_ENCRYPTION_KEY=

# --- Deployment (optional) --------------------------------------------------
# Canonical origin, used for metadata, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
# Defaults to https://dollarandgold.xyz
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
